# dynatrace_openpipeline_v2_user_events_ingestsources (Data Source)

-> This data source requires the OAuth scope `settings:objects:read`.

The `dynatrace_openpipeline_v2_user_events_ingestsources` data source retrieves all matching user events ingest source configurations.

